 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its extended play of about 5 minutes: the launcher, Load",
  "ROM on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there and says so),",
  "Start Game, the logos and the attract demo, then Start (Enter) to the main menu and A (Space) through New Game, a slot",
  "and a name to the intro story, as a player does: the menus go by the level the game is in, tools/survey.js's level().",
  "The intro story plays 25 s, and then the plan changes level as the game's own exits do (survey.js's go(), each a need",
  "that fails the run unless the game plays that level): the prison ship (jail_20), A through its first lines, and the",
  "Woods of Light (learn_10), walked and jumped about for 40 s. Then five more levels of the game's table of levels,",
  "learn_30, ski_10, chase_10, water_10, glob_10, 25 s each, the same way. Its waits and holds are on the game's own",
  "clock (survey.js's clock(), 60 a second of play).",
  "The menu shot is 3 s into the menu on that clock too, which stands still while Firefox builds the shader list's boot",
  "section as the menu first draws, the game waiting: 3 s of the browser's time there can shoot that wait's black."
